WEBVTT

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.240
Magic Knight Rayearth
I, Hikaru Shidou,
along with Umi and Fuu...

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.400
I, Hikaru Shidou,
along with Umi and Fuu...

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.940
...was summoned again
to the world called Cephiro.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.070
This country lost the Pillar who
supported it, Princess Emeraude...

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.980
...and was facing total destruction.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.620
A commander named Eagle from
Autozam, a country invading Cephiro...

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:33.860
...dueled Lantis for his sword,
which is a key to the crown room.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:39.300
When I got there,
Lantis's sword began to glow...

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:44.070
...and all three of us were teleported
right in front of the crown room.

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:47.700
Eagle wanted the proof of the Pillar...

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:51.270
...but we entered
the room simultaneously.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:57.310
But will it be Eagle who'll
become Cephiro's Pillar?

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.550
Or will it be me?

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:08.020
I feel it trembling
in the bottom of my heart...

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:12.800
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:18.230
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:24.410
And my love, full of pride,
comes to life right in front of me.

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:32.460
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:34.890
The warm, red
shades of the sunset...

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.450
...have a melancholy beauty.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:45.640
Solitary tears fall into
the sea that I sealed away...

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:49.400
...inside my heart.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:53.630
The bright light that I missed
will not come back to me.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:59.910
So I want freedom, just like the wind
that will come with the next sunrise.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:07.580
I feel it trembling in
the bottom of my heart...

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:12.260
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:17.760
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:21.940
Someday I want to find for myself...

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:28.130
...a future that has no end.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:37.110
A Serious Match!
Umi vs. Tarta & Tatra

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:07.950
Lantis.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.280
The proof of the Pillar...

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:46.080
You came here concerning
Princess Emeraude's crown?

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.030
The magic ring was reacting.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:58.390
Someone who could become
the Pillar was getting close.

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:09.340
Hikaru and Eagle. The two
of them went inside that room.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.840
And...

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:14.270
Both of them made it out safely.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.410
Only one can become the Pillar.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:22.750
But why were both of them
approved by the magic in that room?

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:27.990
The crown is already
changing its shape.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:44.340
Hikaru or the one from Autozam...

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.210
Which one is to be the next Pillar?

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.480
Lantis!

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:58.560
Lantis!

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.290
I'm sure he's with Hikaru!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.490
Jeez!

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:06.400
What's so good about her?
She's only a little taller than me!

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:08.940
I have bigger breasts than her!

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:10.330
Jeez!

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.430
Lantis, you idiot!

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.310
What are you doing?

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:24.650
W-W-What?

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:38.270
What's that?
You're impersonating Hikaru?

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:47.170
You're trying to say
Hikaru's a good person?

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:56.210
Anyone who gets between me
and Lantis is an evil, evil, evil person!

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:01.950
What?

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.140
Tarta...

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:27.440
Tatra...

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:29.920
Chizeta, huh?

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:34.650
It don't seem Hikaru'll
be able to wake up for a while...

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:38.190
Master Mage Clef ain't
feelin' too chipper either...

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.990
The master mage didn't say so...

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:44.560
...but his condition
is not something to take lightly.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:49.500
The situation is
becoming more cumbersome.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:54.630
I'm going.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:55.840
Umi!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:07:01.370
I heard the princesses' reason for
why Chizeta was invading Cephiro.

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:02.880
But still...

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:05.010
...I decided to fight.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.520
I'll go too.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.420
Ascot!

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.720
You might be going into danger.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:15.850
I can't sit around and
do nothing anymore.

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:18.930
You don't know if it'll
be dangerous or not yet.

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:22.900
I promised my friends
that I would protect you.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.360
All of my friends love you.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:32.310
And I love you too, Umi.

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.270
He finally said it.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.660
I love you too, Ascot.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:50.720
Just like I love Presea,
Caldina, Lafarga, and Ferio.

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:01.170
So protect the castle.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:06.040
Then it won't matter who attacks,
and I can fight with no worries...

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.960
Ms. Umi, I will go as well!

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:20.920
You stay here.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:24.190
The commander from
Autozam is still in the castle.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:27.740
Also, we don't know when
those monsters will return.

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:32.740
If I'm in any danger, I'll call for you.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.840
Umi...

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.810
Selece!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:17.250
You decided, right?

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:22.160
Do everything so you won't regret it.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:31.670
Will I have to fight
those weird spirits again?

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.340
They're not attacking.

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:09.560
Umi Ryuuzaki.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.900
Tarta and Tatra of Chizeta...

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:18.240
...in the name of the royal family,
desire a duel with you!

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.150
Duel...

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:23.980
I and my elder sister Tatra
will each have one bout.

00:10:24.090 --> 00:10:25.920
Not spirit versus Rune-God.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:30.120
We will determine the outcome
with only our personal strength!

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:34.260
If you win, we will stop
the invasion of Cephiro.

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.020
Selece.

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:40.170
What is it, Umi?

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:44.370
I want to believe
the princesses of Chizeta.

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:47.910
It might be reckless
to fight them by myself...

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:52.140
...but I feel those two
will fight me fair and square.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.770
Fight as thy will desires.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:59.390
In this world, Cephiro,
the believing heart becomes power.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.080
Selece...

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.150
Thou art a warrior.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:08.160
A true warrior always responds to those
possessing hearts with their own.

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:09.200
Yes!

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.990
I accept that challenge.

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.850
That is where we will fight!

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:46.070
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:50.710
Lantis Primera
Cephiro

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:53.040
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:56.670
Chizeta
Tatra Tarta

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:17.330
One bout per match.

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:20.870
We fight until one of us
can't fight anymore!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.410
Here we go!

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:09.140
If your foot slips,
you'll fall straight down.

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:18.860
You're strong...

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:23.490
I can't lose here no matter what!

00:13:53.530 --> 00:13:56.430
Sapphire Whirlwind!

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:10.540
Ow...

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:16.880
Are you all right?

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:21.180
Why'd you save me?

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:26.260
I just had to go till you
couldn't fight anymore, right?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:48.580
Ms. Umi...

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.090
It's all right.

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:54.880
Umi won't lose.

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:57.550
We have to trust her.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.160
My turn now.

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:20.910
Tatra...

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:26.610
My sister is very strong.
Nobody in Chizeta can win against her.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:41.130
I challenge you!

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:54.340
She is strong!

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:11.220
Umi!

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:13.730
Ms. Umi!

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:25.180
I can't lose.

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:31.140
If I lose here, I'll have
no choice but to fight you again.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.650
I absolutely can't lose!

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:45.630
You truly have a strong will.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.600
Tarta...

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:33.810
I-I...

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:02.910
Sister!

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:07.580
Ms. Umi...

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:22.590
Tatra!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:23.690
Sister!

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:28.900
Are you all right? Are you hurt?

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:37.330
I'm all right. Just a little surprised.

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:40.210
Tatra...

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.210
You saved her.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:48.220
I-I'm sorry!

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:58.590
It's all right.
Even if you hadn't saved her...

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.670
...I'm sure she would
have won against me.

00:19:01.770 --> 00:19:03.100
Tatra...

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:06.130
Are you satisfied now?

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:12.140
We have lost.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:16.210
From now on, Chizeta will
have nothing to do with Cephiro.

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:17.290
Really?

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.750
Yes, we promised.

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:28.720
So I don't have
to fight you two anymore?

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:29.920
Yeah...

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:33.130
Maybe we can be friends.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:38.240
M-Maybe if you fix that violent streak.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:40.270
Who'd you say was violent?

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:41.270
You!

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:42.930
You're one to talk.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.200
What's that mean?

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:48.870
When they say "violent," they're
talking about people like you! Get it?

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:50.210
Say what?

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:51.080
What?

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:52.090
You pickin' a fight?

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.680
You pickin' a fight?
You're on!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:54.490
All right!

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:55.350
All right!
Oh my.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:58.860
You two get along
so wonderfully together!

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:08.100
The proof of the Pillar...

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:11.270
It's starting to change its shape.

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:46.140
If all of this sand falls...

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:48.800
...Cephiro will crumble.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:54.080
Before a new Pillar is born...

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:59.020
...I must return everything
in Cephiro to nothing.

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:00.150
Nova!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.920
What is it, Mother?

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:14.400
That Magic Knight who created you...

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.130
Do you want to see her?

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:22.740
I want to see her!
I want to play with Hikaru!

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:25.770
Then I'll give you something nice.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.470
Seville! Alba!

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:36.450
Take them along.

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:42.830
Fill Cephiro's castle with fear
and confusion once more.

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:48.360
So that Cephiro will
disappear one day sooner.

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:52.400
So that I will have
even more power.

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:54.930
Yes, Mother!

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:57.640
Seville!

00:21:57.750 --> 00:21:58.910
Alba!

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:05.180
Come with me.

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:20.530
Shine someday.
Believing is just that.

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:30.040
Because it gives me
the courage to live on now.

00:22:32.110 --> 00:22:38.210
Blown by the winds of the ages.

00:22:39.590 --> 00:22:44.680
Groping around for tomorrow.

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:52.760
Darkness spreads,
and only worries...

00:22:54.440 --> 00:22:59.500
...keep welling up.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:07.540
I will definitely find bright feelings...

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:14.250
...when I get over the sea of tears.

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:23.560
Someday I will find it,
and the unyielding future...

00:23:24.230 --> 00:23:32.870
...will lead dreams
to a world full of light.

00:23:46.350 --> 00:23:48.450
I'm Tarta of Chizeta!

00:23:48.560 --> 00:23:53.520
I'm her elder sister, Tatra. It's good
you're friends with Umi now, Tarta.

00:23:54.130 --> 00:23:55.100
I guess.

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:59.690
But Cephiro still seems to be
in dangerous circumstances.

00:23:59.800 --> 00:24:02.600
Next time on Magic Knight Rayearth...

