Desperate Situation!
Crisis Upon Lantis. Watch it.

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:09.440
I wonder what kind of person
Lantis is. Is he attractive?

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:09.640
Desperate Situation!
Crisis Upon Lantis
I wonder what kind of person
Lantis is. Is he attractive?

00:24:09.640 --> 00:24:11.780
Desperate Situation!
Crisis Upon Lantis
Jeez, Sister!

00:24:11.780 --> 00:24:13.450
Desperate Situation!
Crisis Upon Lantis

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:20.350
Who is it today?

00:24:21.490 --> 00:24:23.350
Today, it's Primera!

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:23.830
Look forward to the next episode!

